    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch02-04: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.22";
    dc:description "Specific natural phenomena can be studied with existing observations, but no dataset or analysis covers the claimed majority of natural complexity. The causal wording also requires discrimination beyond demonstrations that simple programs can look complex.";
