    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For selected natural phenomena, compare causal generative models based on simple rules and initial conditions against rival mechanisms using held-out observations. Quantify the fraction of predeclared natural-complexity domains in which the simple-rule mechanism has decisive predictive support.";
